{{Term/Store|Toasty Razorshroom|Toasty Razorshrooms|Series, BotW, TotK|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory">{{Cite|{{Big|Toasty Razorshroom}}<br/>A razorshroom that's been exposed to direct heat. Its sharp exterior has softened considerably. Restores a bit of health.|Inventory|BotW}}</ref><ref name="TotK Inventory">{{Cite|{{Big|Toasty Razorshroom}}<br/>A razorshroom that's been exposed to direct heat. Its sharp exterior has softened considerably. Restores a bit of health.|Inventory|TotK}}</ref>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Toasty Razorshrooms are a type of [[Roasted Food]], and they are made by exposing [[Razorshroom]]s to [[Fire]] or a [[Scorching Climate]].<ref>{{Cite Guide|BotW Piggyback|page= 295}}</ref> The roasting process softens the exterior of the Razorshroom.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> Eating one restores three-quarters of a [[Heart]] to [[Link]].

==={{TotK|-}}===
Toasty Razorshrooms reappear in {{TotK}} and are again a variety of [[Roasted Food]]. [[Link]] can make them by burning [[Razorshroom]]s in a [[Fire]] or a [[Scorching Climate]]. Their exteriors are known to soften after being roasted.<ref name="TotK Inventory"/> If Link eats a Toasty Razorshroom, he will heal three-quarters of a [[Heart]].

